{
  "chapter": "patterns/cost/model-cascade",
  "tier": "micro",
  "notes": [
    "Cheapest model first. Escalate only when its confidence falls below the threshold.",
    "The last rung is accepted whatever it scores — there is nothing above it, and",
    "returning nothing is not better than returning the best available answer.",
    "`spent` includes every model called, so a cascade that escalates often costs more",
    "than never cascading at all. That is the number the pattern lives or dies on."
  ],
  "ladder": [
    { "model": "haiku", "cost": 5 },
    { "model": "sonnet", "cost": 20 },
    { "model": "opus", "cost": 100 }
  ],
  "threshold": 0.8,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "a-confident-cheap-answer-stops-the-cascade",
      "confidences": [0.95],
      "result": { "answeredBy": "haiku", "tried": ["haiku"], "spent": 5, "escalated": false }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-threshold-is-inclusive",
      "confidences": [0.8],
      "result": { "answeredBy": "haiku", "tried": ["haiku"], "spent": 5, "escalated": false }
    },
    {
      "id": "low-confidence-escalates-one-rung",
      "confidences": [0.4, 0.9],
      "result": {
        "answeredBy": "sonnet",
        "tried": ["haiku", "sonnet"],
        "spent": 25,
        "escalated": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-cascade-climbs-until-something-is-confident",
      "confidences": [0.2, 0.3, 0.99],
      "result": {
        "answeredBy": "opus",
        "tried": ["haiku", "sonnet", "opus"],
        "spent": 125,
        "escalated": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-top-rung-is-accepted-however-unsure-it-is",
      "confidences": [0.1, 0.1, 0.1],
      "result": {
        "answeredBy": "opus",
        "tried": ["haiku", "sonnet", "opus"],
        "spent": 125,
        "escalated": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "escalating-all-the-way-costs-more-than-going-straight-to-the-top",
      "confidences": [0.1, 0.1, 0.5],
      "result": {
        "answeredBy": "opus",
        "tried": ["haiku", "sonnet", "opus"],
        "spent": 125,
        "escalated": true
      }
    }
  ]
